 King Geudeung, and his mother was Mujeong. His queen consort was Hoju (granddaughter of Blood Minister Jo Gwang), and his son was the fourth ruler, King Geojilmi. He ascended the throne in the 5th year of Jiaping (Guiyou) under Cao Fang. He died on the 29th day of the 1st month in the 1st year of Yongping (Xinhai) under Emperor Hui of Jin. His posthumous title was King Seong.","jp":"金官伽耶（駕洛国）第３代王。父は居登王、母は慕貞。王妃は好仇（宗正監・趙匡の孫娘）、子は第４代王の居叱弥王。曹芳の嘉平５年（癸酉）に即位。晋の恵帝の永平元年（辛亥）１月２９日に崩御した。諡号は成王。","kr":"금관가야(가락국)의 제3대 왕입니다. 아버지는 거등왕, 어머니는 모정입니다. 왕비는 호구(종정감 조광의 손녀)이며, 아들은 제4대 왕인 거질미왕입니다. 조방 가평 5년(계유년)에 즉위하였고, 진 혜제 영평 원년(신해년) 1월 29일에 붕어하였습니다. 시호는 성왕입니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1050315","remark":"普武","surname":"金","surnameTc":"金","surnameEn":"Kim","surnameJp":"金","surnameKr":"금","surnameOther":"","name":"麻品","nameTc":"麻品","nameEn":"Mapum","nameJp":"麻品","nameKr":"마품","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"金麻品","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"190","city":"CS1068","gender":"0","rule":"52","force":"55","wise":"54","politics":"54","charm":"54","will":"56","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"23/27/32/55/28/28/26/24","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"2300","battleSoulPoint":"3700","debateSoulPoint":"3200","strategy":"","strategy2":"1008501","professions":"1/3/1/2/0/0/2/0/1/1/0/0/2/2/1/0/2/1/1/1/0/2/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"95","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"8300","title":"1","rank":"1","birth":"206","show":"220","death":"291",